# =============================================================================
# Content production system — public GitHub backup
# Policy: keep the reusable production SYSTEM (code, configs, docs, brand fonts and
# textures, licence sidecars) plus two finished reference videos. Do NOT commit raw
# media, licensed stock, private voice recordings, environments, tools or renders.
# The full rationale is in CONTENT_PRODUCTION_HANDBOOK.md §I.
# =============================================================================

# ---- secrets (never commit) --------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials*.json
service-account*.json
client_secret*.json
token*.json

# ---- environments, dependencies, caches -------------------------------------
node_modules/
